---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy notice" noindex
  ><section class="wrap page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Real product / Legal</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  </section><section class="wrap section">
    <div class="prose legal">
      <p class="notice">
        Draft for launch review. Legal identity, contact address, jurisdiction,
        retention period and contracted processors must be confirmed before
        accepting live requests.
      </p><h2>What this website collects</h2><p>
        The Reality Check form asks for your name, email, product URL, optional
        repository URL and context about your product. Do not submit passwords,
        API keys, customer records or sensitive personal information.
      </p><h2>Why the information is used</h2><p>
        The intended purpose is to assess your request, reply to you and agree
        any next steps. A request does not sign you up to a newsletter.
      </p><h2>Delivery and storage</h2><p>
        When configured, form details are sent through Resend to the service
        operator's inbox. Hosting and rate limiting providers may process
        technical request information. Provider configuration and data retention
        must be confirmed before launch.
      </p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>
        No analytics service or advertising cookies are enabled in this version.
        The website does not persist form entries in browser storage. Future
        analytics changes require an updated notice.
      </p><h2>Your questions and rights</h2><p>
        [REQUIRED BEFORE LAUNCH: controller's legal identity, privacy contact,
        applicable legal basis, retention periods, international transfer
        details and rights procedure.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </section></Base
>
